<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Over Cooked</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Bhad Bhabie</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Over Cooked</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0pyGQQMdsVNcxlzzlIrITs</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.180" end="00:04.480">Bitch you want my life, you want the dick I get</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.480" end="00:06.380">You wanna worship the ground I walk on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.380" end="00:08.500">'Cause you idolize me bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.500" end="00:12.330">Get it right or don't get it at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.330" end="00:14.380">Oh, you mad 'cause you want him (want him)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.380" end="00:16.270">And ain't get nothin'? (ain't get nothin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.270" end="00:19.560">But you love him? this bitch a dummy (haha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.560" end="00:21.060">Oh, you want him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.920" end="00:22.440">And ain't get nothin'? (ain't get nothin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.440" end="00:25.320">This bitch stupid, thought I was 'bout to get mad and dump him (never)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.320" end="00:28.270">This bitch dumb and a slut for no reason, get some money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.270" end="00:29.770">Talkin' 'bout me? bitch, you broke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.720" end="00:31.950">I done ran it up a hunnid, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.950" end="00:35.280">New car, new crib, type of bitch make him spend cash on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.280" end="00:38.430">New lips, new tits, new waist, bitch look bad, don't she?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.430" end="00:39.990">Backstabbin' ass lil' bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.990" end="00:41.550">Can't wait to crash you bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.550" end="00:43.260">When I get my hands on a bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.260" end="00:44.810">Make her look like a brand new bitch (ah ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.810" end="00:46.310">Go and ask daddy for some money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.180" end="00:47.970">Everybody know that's how you get it (ah ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.970" end="00:49.590">Everybody know this bitch weird</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.590" end="00:51.090">Everybody know that I'm the biggest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.010" end="00:54.400">Hatin' ass hoe tried steal my baby daddy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.400" end="00:57.420">Fuckin' on-, and-, got you pregnant</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.420" end="01:00.590">Tried to play me close, backdoor me, seen it comin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.590" end="01:03.960">Did all that for nothin', bitch, he still gon' come right back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.960" end="01:05.720">Oh, you mad 'cause you want him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.720" end="01:07.530">And ain't get nothin'? (ain't get nothin'?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.530" end="01:09.150">But you love him? (but you love him?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.150" end="01:10.700">This bitch a dummy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.700" end="01:12.210">Oh, you want him (oh you want him)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.210" end="01:13.940">And ain't get nothin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.940" end="01:16.500">This bitch stupid, thought I was 'bout to get mad and dump him (never)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.500" end="01:19.440">Gotta watch them type of bitches, always in somebody man face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.440" end="01:20.940">Want everything I got</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.820" end="01:23.270">Even wanna know how my pussy taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.270" end="01:26.310">Everything I know is gettin' rich, I feel like 50, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.310" end="01:27.940">Platinum, I got gold plaques</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.940" end="01:30.220">With me like I'm Britney, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.220" end="01:33.130">Five cars, three mansions, these bitches can't keep up (can never)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.130" end="01:34.810">Ten million, twenty million, stop countin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.810" end="01:36.440">Gettin' too much (gettin' too much)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.440" end="01:39.580">Why would I compete with a weird bitch that just get fucked? (why would I?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.580" end="01:42.600">Keep lyin', keep talkin', keep tweetin' 'til she get touched</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.600" end="01:44.280">Oh, you mad 'cause you want him (you bitches don't like me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.280" end="01:46.480">And ain't get nothin'? (you bitches wanna be me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.480" end="01:49.650">But you love him? this bitch a dummy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.650" end="01:51.150">Oh, you want him (bitch you've been idolizing me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.040" end="01:53.090">And ain't get nothin'? (since I was hanging with your brother)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.090" end="01:56.140">This bitch stupid, thought I was 'bout to get mad and dump him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.140" end="01:58.410">You're such an airhead dummy, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.410" end="01:59.910">You can't put your lawyers on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.790" end="02:01.560">'Cause everything I say is factual</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.560" end="02:04.720">Everything I say is the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.720" end="02:06.320">You need daddy's money to fuck with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.320" end="02:07.820">More like step mommy's money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.350" end="02:11.580">'Cause I got more money than your daddy little girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.580" end="02:15.580" /></div></body></tt>